        <p class="lead" style="margin: 16px auto 0;">Platform Engineer at Interbank (remote, Peru). Open to senior roles · notice: immediate.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 32px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:luis.m.paz.03@gmail.com">Email me</a>
          <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/cv.pdf" download="LuisPaz-CV.pdf">Download CV</a>
